      "statusChangeID": "656e3e945650dc45c0977938",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This behaviour change is intentional and will be kept. The large majority of worlds has been improved by this change, and the small amount of counterpoints you brought up can easily be fixed by the world creators.\n\nThe previous behaviour of a minimum distance existing was undocumented and as such unsupported, there was never a guarantee that it'd be kept. Any world that has sliders set to 0 or similar low values was relying on unsupported behaviour, and by definition, can not be supported for changes like these. Grandfathering existing content would also go against that, aside from being hard to do on a strictly technical level for little gain.\n\nThe new behaviour is documented and can be relied on for the future.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
